WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.901
♪♪

00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:05.167
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:07.067
President Biden today signed the

00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:09.634
bipartisan infrastructure
bill into law.

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:12.634
And I think it's good that
he's finally taking action

00:00:12.634 --> 00:00:17.400
against the dilapidated
and crumbling approval rating.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.200
Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.200
did not attend today's
signing ceremony

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.334
for the bipartisan
infrastructure bill.

00:00:23.334 --> 00:00:26.834
But in another middle finger
to the right, Big Bird did.

00:00:28.934 --> 00:00:31.834
Former President Trump released
a statement on Saturday

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:35.200
encouraging primary campaigns
against Republican House members

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:38.033
who voted for the bipartisan
infrastructure bill and said,

00:00:38.033 --> 00:00:41.033
"Saving America starts
by saving the GOP

00:00:41.033 --> 00:00:44.067
from RINOs, sellouts,
and known losers."

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:46.334
Take it from him,
all of those things.

00:00:48.167 --> 00:00:51.100
In his new book,
former New Jersey
Governor Chris Christie

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:52.901
writes that
while he was hospitalized

00:00:52.901 --> 00:00:54.234
with the coronavirus,

00:00:54.234 --> 00:00:56.801
former President Trump
called him to ask him,

00:00:56.801 --> 00:00:59.934
"Are you going to say
you got it from me?"

00:00:59.934 --> 00:01:04.334
Aww! That's actually --
That's actually sweet.

00:01:04.334 --> 00:01:07.534
Just like the card he sent when
Melania was pregnant.

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:10.834
[ Ohs and applause ]

00:01:10.834 --> 00:01:11.901
Now...

00:01:13.801 --> 00:01:15.767
After Senator Bernie Sanders
tweeted,

00:01:15.767 --> 00:01:18.100
"We must demand that
the extremely wealthy

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:19.367
pay their fair share,"

00:01:19.367 --> 00:01:22.501
Tesla CEO Elon Musk
replied yesterday and said,

00:01:22.501 --> 00:01:26.334
"I keep forgetting
that you're still alive."

00:01:26.334 --> 00:01:29.634
Wow. Well, that is one
of the side effects.

00:01:31.834 --> 00:01:35.234
Vice President Kamala Harris
has reportedly told confidants

00:01:35.234 --> 00:01:38.133
that she feels constrained
with what she's able to do,

00:01:38.133 --> 00:01:40.100
politically,
in the Biden administration.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.868
"Same," said Biden.

00:01:44.968 --> 00:01:47.801
On a new episode of his podcast,
Joe Rogan said

00:01:47.801 --> 00:01:49.234
that he's so flexible,

00:01:49.234 --> 00:01:52.334
he's capable of performing
oral sex on himself,

00:01:52.334 --> 00:01:53.767
or, as he calls it,

00:01:53.767 --> 00:01:55.334
"Doing my own research."

00:01:59.367 --> 00:02:03.367
And, finally, Buckingham Palace
announced yesterday

00:02:03.367 --> 00:02:05.267
that Britain's Queen Elizabeth
skipped

00:02:05.267 --> 00:02:09.000
a Remembrance Day Ceremony
due to a sprained back muscle.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.934
Apparently,
she heard that Rogan story

00:02:10.934 --> 00:02:13.300
and wanted to give it a shot.

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:15.434
Picture it.
Picture it.

00:02:19.434 --> 00:02:20.767
♪♪

00:02:20.767 --> 00:02:22.267
President Biden signed

00:02:22.267 --> 00:02:23.767
the bipartisan
infrastructure bill

00:02:23.767 --> 00:02:27.200
into law yesterday and said,
"America is moving again.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:29.601
And, this time, not to Canada."

00:02:29.601 --> 00:02:30.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.968 --> 00:02:33.033
During the signing
ceremony yesterday

00:02:33.033 --> 00:02:34.767
for the bipartisan
infrastructure bill,

00:02:34.767 --> 00:02:36.801
President Biden twice referred

00:02:36.801 --> 00:02:39.067
to Arizona
Senator Kyrsten Sinema

00:02:39.067 --> 00:02:42.300
as Krysten, and that's the worst
thing you can call her,

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.534
besides a Democrat.

00:02:43.534 --> 00:02:46.000
She hates that.
[ Ohs and laughter ]

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.434
According to a new book,

00:02:47.434 --> 00:02:50.133
former acting Defense Secretary
Christopher Miller

00:02:50.133 --> 00:02:52.200
purposely offered
then-President Trump

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:53.968
extreme military scenarios

00:02:53.968 --> 00:02:55.701
in the final weeks
of his presidency,

00:02:55.701 --> 00:02:58.501
to prevent him
from choosing to attack Iran.

00:02:58.501 --> 00:03:01.300
Unfortunately, he opted
for the craziest one --

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:03.033
attacking the U.S.

00:03:03.033 --> 00:03:05.868
[ Laughter and oohs ]

00:03:05.868 --> 00:03:08.234
I guess that's about as well
as that one could've gone.

00:03:08.234 --> 00:03:09.501
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.501 --> 00:03:10.834
"You guys remember
that awful day.

00:03:10.834 --> 00:03:11.834
Ha ha ha ha ha.

00:03:11.834 --> 00:03:13.334
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.334 --> 00:03:16.267
Ha ha ha ha ha."

00:03:16.267 --> 00:03:18.367
Former Trump advisor
Steve Bannon surrendered

00:03:18.367 --> 00:03:21.000
to federal authorities yesterday
to face charges

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.501
of contempt of Congress and,
looking at him,

00:03:23.501 --> 00:03:25.033
I have to assume Congress is

00:03:25.033 --> 00:03:26.434
a brand of soap?

00:03:26.434 --> 00:03:28.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:28.534 --> 00:03:30.968
The Biden administration
has announced it's planning

00:03:30.968 --> 00:03:33.567
to hold the annual White House
Christmas party this year,

00:03:33.567 --> 00:03:35.200
but, for the first time
in four years,

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:36.501
without Frosty.

00:03:36.501 --> 00:03:40.033
[ Laughter and oohs ]

00:03:40.033 --> 00:03:42.200
After being treated
for the coronavirus

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.267
at Walter Reed Medical Center
last year,

00:03:44.267 --> 00:03:46.801
former President Trump
reportedly considered

00:03:46.801 --> 00:03:48.234
ripping off his dress shirt

00:03:48.234 --> 00:03:49.567
when he returned
to the White House,

00:03:49.567 --> 00:03:52.067
to reveal a Superman shirt
underneath.

00:03:52.067 --> 00:03:53.200
But then, he remembered

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.267
Superman was
an "undocamented inmigrant."

00:03:55.267 --> 00:03:57.000
[ Laughter and oohs ]

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.367
Definitely said
both those words wrong.

00:03:59.367 --> 00:04:00.834
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.834 --> 00:04:02.701
It is "undocamented," right?

00:04:02.701 --> 00:04:05.367
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.367 --> 00:04:07.400
What happened was the wheels
came off on undocumented

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:08.868
and then, I was lost
on immigrant.

00:04:08.868 --> 00:04:10.133
[ Laughter ]

00:04:10.133 --> 00:04:11.901
I think I used one of the M's
in immigrant

00:04:11.901 --> 00:04:15.634
in undocumented,
so, there's only one left there.

00:04:15.634 --> 00:04:19.567
[ Laughter ]
Guardrails came off, bud.

00:04:19.567 --> 00:04:20.968
You know what?
Just, in post,

00:04:20.968 --> 00:04:22.234
move the "M."

00:04:22.234 --> 00:04:24.567
[ Laughter ]
Audio, if you're listening,

00:04:24.567 --> 00:04:28.534
just take the "M"
from "undocumamented"...

00:04:28.534 --> 00:04:30.234
[ Laughter ]

00:04:30.234 --> 00:04:33.667
...slide it into immigrant
and I think it'll be seamless.

00:04:33.667 --> 00:04:35.300
[ Laughter ]

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:36.501
They'll match it to my lips,

00:04:36.501 --> 00:04:38.534
so, I'll just say it right now
without words

00:04:38.534 --> 00:04:39.968
and then,
you can use these lips.

00:04:41.734 --> 00:04:43.067
[ Laughter ]

00:04:43.067 --> 00:04:44.801
Just watch the show tonight
and see, yeah.

00:04:44.801 --> 00:04:47.234
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:04:47.234 --> 00:04:50.133
Let's see how they
cut it together.

00:04:50.133 --> 00:04:52.901
A woman reportedly climbed
over the barrier

00:04:52.901 --> 00:04:55.267
to Bronx Zoo's lion exhibit
last week

00:04:55.267 --> 00:04:57.100
while carrying a bouquet
of roses,

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:58.267
or, as the lion saw it,

00:04:58.267 --> 00:04:59.934
dinner, holding some garnish.

00:04:59.934 --> 00:05:02.167
[ Laughter and awws ]

00:05:02.167 --> 00:05:05.934
More than 500 people in Egypt
were stung over the weekend

00:05:05.934 --> 00:05:09.701
after flooding drove thousands
of scorpions into villages.

00:05:09.701 --> 00:05:12.100
And that's why you don't tap
on the glass

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:13.400
of King Tut's mummy!

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:15.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:15.934 --> 00:05:17.067
And, finally --

00:05:17.067 --> 00:05:18.834
[ Laughter ]

00:05:18.834 --> 00:05:20.334
Is it a good sign or a bad sign

00:05:20.334 --> 00:05:22.234
when I can only hear
Wally laughing?

00:05:22.234 --> 00:05:26.100
[ Laughter ]

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:27.801
And fi--

00:05:27.801 --> 00:05:29.567
I think you're laughing
because nobody else was, Wally,

00:05:29.567 --> 00:05:30.667
and I don't like that.

00:05:30.667 --> 00:05:33.434
[ Laughter ]

00:05:33.434 --> 00:05:34.567
Oh, keep it up, Wally.

00:05:34.567 --> 00:05:35.801
[ Laughter ]

00:05:35.801 --> 00:05:37.901
And, finally,
the restaurant chain Applebee's

00:05:37.901 --> 00:05:40.567
began offering so-called
Cosmic Wings yesterday,

00:05:40.567 --> 00:05:42.367
which features chicken tossed

00:05:42.367 --> 00:05:45.000
in Original or Flamin' Hot
Cheetos cheese sauce,

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:46.934
and that's not all
they're tossed in.

00:05:46.934 --> 00:05:48.334
♪♪

00:05:48.334 --> 00:05:51.200
Senate Majority Leader
Chuck Schumer said yesterday

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:53.868
that President Biden's
Build Back Better agenda

00:05:53.868 --> 00:05:56.033
will come up for a vote
before Christmas,

00:05:56.033 --> 00:05:57.634
which is good,
because right now,

00:05:57.634 --> 00:06:00.434
that manger is,
like, our sturdiest building.

00:06:01.868 --> 00:06:03.734
President Biden
visited General Motors'

00:06:03.734 --> 00:06:06.801
so-called Factory ZERO
electric-vehicle assembly plant

00:06:06.801 --> 00:06:09.400
today in Michigan and you
could tell he was impressed.

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:12.033
He kept saying,
"So it's fully electric?

00:06:12.033 --> 00:06:13.834
No horses at all?"

00:06:15.968 --> 00:06:19.234
Jacob Chansley,
also known as the QAnon Shaman

00:06:19.234 --> 00:06:21.167
from the January
Capitol insurrection

00:06:21.167 --> 00:06:23.000
has been sentenced
to 41 months in prison.

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:25.868
Apparently, it's hard to find
a jury of his peers

00:06:25.868 --> 00:06:27.901
the same day there's
a Renaissance fair.

00:06:29.934 --> 00:06:32.734
It's been announced that
the Los Angeles Staples Center

00:06:32.734 --> 00:06:35.834
will change its name
to the Crypto.com Arena.

00:06:35.834 --> 00:06:39.167
So look for the Lakers to be
up by 20, then back down by 40,

00:06:39.167 --> 00:06:41.234
then up by 10,000,

00:06:41.234 --> 00:06:43.834
then back to zero.

00:06:43.834 --> 00:06:47.000
Montana Senator Jon Tester
joked with reporters yesterday

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:49.534
that he expects
Democratic efforts to pass

00:06:49.534 --> 00:06:51.767
President Biden's
Build Back Better agenda

00:06:51.767 --> 00:06:53.501
to screw up his holiday plans.

00:06:53.501 --> 00:06:55.300
Well, if it makes you
feel any better,

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:56.667
you're a Democrat in Montana.

00:06:56.667 --> 00:07:00.100
Your relatives probably don't
want to see you anyway.

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:02.234
The New Year's Eve celebration
in Times Square

00:07:02.234 --> 00:07:04.834
will return in-person this year
for participants

00:07:04.834 --> 00:07:06.901
who are fully vaccinated
against the coronavirus.

00:07:06.901 --> 00:07:08.834
But if you're unvaccinated,
you'll have to settle

00:07:08.834 --> 00:07:10.067
for going to the Super Bowl.

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:14.634
Officials in Florida
recently discovered

00:07:14.634 --> 00:07:17.701
a 20-foot-long metal box
washed up on a beach.

00:07:17.701 --> 00:07:21.701
Even weirder,
there wasn't any cocaine in it.

00:07:21.701 --> 00:07:24.801
Well, now I've
seen everything, Florida.

00:07:24.801 --> 00:07:27.801
Google Cloud services
experienced an outage yesterday

00:07:27.801 --> 00:07:30.934
which caused the music
platform Spotify to crash,

00:07:30.934 --> 00:07:34.701
costing artists a total
of over 75 cents in profits.

00:07:36.734 --> 00:07:39.701
Costco and Kraft Heinz
issued a recall last week

00:07:39.701 --> 00:07:42.901
for Kool-Aid drink mix
due to possible contamination

00:07:42.901 --> 00:07:45.267
of small pieces
of metal or glass.

00:07:45.267 --> 00:07:47.234
Okay, well, here's a suggestion.

00:07:47.234 --> 00:07:49.801
Stop delivering it
through walls.

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:54.067
That's modern, right?
That's still --

00:07:54.067 --> 00:07:55.901
That's like
a modern ad campaign?

00:07:59.634 --> 00:08:02.868
[ Laughter ]

00:08:02.868 --> 00:08:06.267
I'm really excited
about this one.

00:08:06.267 --> 00:08:08.334
The sex-toy company
Dame Products

00:08:08.334 --> 00:08:10.767
announced this week that it
has settled its lawsuit

00:08:10.767 --> 00:08:12.534
with New York's MTA

00:08:12.534 --> 00:08:15.234
and will be allowed to advertise
the brand on the subway,

00:08:15.234 --> 00:08:19.067
though still no plan in place
to make the train come faster.

00:08:20.934 --> 00:08:23.467
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:08:23.467 --> 00:08:24.968
First down!

00:08:24.968 --> 00:08:26.968
[ Laughter ]

00:08:30.868 --> 00:08:35.701
And, finally, boxer --
Former professional boxer --

00:08:35.701 --> 00:08:38.334
And, finally, former
professional boxer Mike Tyson

00:08:38.334 --> 00:08:40.234
said in a new interview
that he takes

00:08:40.234 --> 00:08:43.567
Sonoran Desert tone venom --

00:08:43.567 --> 00:08:45.267
We're going to reboot and we're
going to get this right.

00:08:45.267 --> 00:08:47.634
I'm just so excited about that
"train come faster" joke.

00:08:47.634 --> 00:08:49.834
[ Laughter ]

00:08:49.834 --> 00:08:51.367
You know what I mean?
Like I know everybody's like,

00:08:51.367 --> 00:08:52.934
"Move on to the next joke,"
but I want to live

00:08:52.934 --> 00:08:54.968
in the last one.
[ Laughter ]

00:08:57.167 --> 00:09:00.167
And, finally, former
professional boxer Mike Tyson

00:09:00.167 --> 00:09:04.133
said in a new interview that he
takes Sonoran Desert toad venom

00:09:04.133 --> 00:09:05.267
to hallucinate.

00:09:05.267 --> 00:09:06.534
Responded the interviewer,

00:09:06.534 --> 00:09:07.801
"I'm a lamp."

00:09:07.801 --> 00:09:09.234
[ Laughter ]

00:09:09.234 --> 00:09:10.868
♪♪

00:09:10.868 --> 00:09:13.200
President Biden is set tomorrow

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:15.334
to pardon the annual
White House turkey

00:09:15.334 --> 00:09:19.200
and Steve Bannon's got an idea
just crazy enough to work.

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:21.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:21.434 --> 00:09:24.100
After test driving
an electric Hummer pickup truck

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:26.234
in Michigan yesterday,
President Biden said,

00:09:26.234 --> 00:09:27.801
"This sucker's something else."

00:09:27.801 --> 00:09:29.934
Okay, but, don't give him one.

00:09:29.934 --> 00:09:31.734
I mean, the last thing
anyone needs is

00:09:31.734 --> 00:09:35.634
a 78-year-old man driving a car
that you can't hear coming.

00:09:35.634 --> 00:09:37.701
[ Laughter ]

00:09:37.701 --> 00:09:39.667
After Texas Senator Ted Cruz

00:09:39.667 --> 00:09:41.834
accused Republican
Congresswoman Liz Cheney,

00:09:41.834 --> 00:09:44.734
in a recent interview, of having
Trump Derangement Syndrome,

00:09:44.734 --> 00:09:47.801
Cheney tweeted,
"Trump broke Ted Cruz."

00:09:47.801 --> 00:09:51.300
Yeah, but that's like breaking
an IKEA bookshelf.

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:53.367
It was about to go, anyway.

00:09:53.367 --> 00:09:55.200
[ Laughter ]
"You put books on it?!

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:57.801
Ohh!
You can't put books on it!"

00:09:57.801 --> 00:09:59.200
[ Laughter ]

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:00.834
Fox Chairman Rupert Murdoch

00:10:00.834 --> 00:10:03.634
reportedly told News Corp's
shareholders -- stockholders --

00:10:03.634 --> 00:10:05.033
Excuse me.
Shareholders, stockholders --

00:10:05.033 --> 00:10:06.100
I think it's the same.

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:07.734
What do you want to go with,
Baze?

00:10:07.734 --> 00:10:09.334
-Share.
-I think stock's funnier.

00:10:09.334 --> 00:10:12.501
[ Laughter and applause ]
Stockholders at a recent meeting

00:10:12.501 --> 00:10:14.968
that former President Trump
"needs to move on"

00:10:14.968 --> 00:10:16.067
from the 2021 election.

00:10:16.067 --> 00:10:17.667
Okay, but you, first.

00:10:17.667 --> 00:10:20.100
[ Laughter ]

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:22.267
Probably hurt the joke,
doing that little side trip,

00:10:22.267 --> 00:10:23.601
but I got my Baze burn in.

00:10:23.601 --> 00:10:26.000
[ Laughter ]

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:28.200
The NFL announced yesterday
that it will heighten

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:31.601
its coronavirus protocols amid
rising cases across the country.

00:10:31.601 --> 00:10:34.167
Starting this weekend,
Aaron Rodgers will be forced

00:10:34.167 --> 00:10:35.901
to attend the huddle via Zoom.

00:10:35.901 --> 00:10:37.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:37.467 --> 00:10:40.767
New York's MTA announced
yesterday that it has approved

00:10:40.767 --> 00:10:43.834
the purchase
of 60 fully electric buses,

00:10:43.834 --> 00:10:47.400
which cost about $1 million each
and have a top speed of

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:48.667
we'll never know.

00:10:48.667 --> 00:10:51.434
[ Laughter ]

00:10:51.434 --> 00:10:54.067
The discount department store
chain T.J.Maxx

00:10:54.067 --> 00:10:56.167
announced yesterday
that it will increase prices

00:10:56.167 --> 00:10:59.334
on some of its upscale brands
and you'll know they're upscale

00:10:59.334 --> 00:11:01.767
because they're the ones not
on the floor.

00:11:01.767 --> 00:11:03.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:11:03.834 --> 00:11:06.033
New York Jets quarterback
Joe Flacco announced

00:11:06.033 --> 00:11:07.400
at a press conference yesterday

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:09.734
that he is not vaccinated
against the coronavirus

00:11:09.734 --> 00:11:12.367
and said that he
"has his reasons."

00:11:12.367 --> 00:11:14.868
I mean, he's a backup
quarterback on the Jets.

00:11:14.868 --> 00:11:17.367
I assume his reason is
that he's ready to die.

00:11:17.367 --> 00:11:21.467
[ Laughter ]

00:11:21.467 --> 00:11:24.334
That's right, New York Jets
quarterback Joe Flacco announced

00:11:24.334 --> 00:11:26.634
he's not vaccinated
against the coronavirus,

00:11:26.634 --> 00:11:28.400
but don't worry
about his teammates.

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:30.734
It's rare for the Jets
to catch anything.

